<title>GERMANY: BMW sales climb to 37.54 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>BMW sales climb to 37.54 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>January to September. In millions of marks unless stated.</p>
<p>    Group sales				 37,537   vs 33,933</p>
<p>    Group car output (units)		826,733  vs 820,148</p>
<p>    Group car deliveries (units)	  863,037  vs 795,552</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car maker Bayerische Motoren Werke AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
